<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Final Surprise</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: peachpuff;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .photo-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 80vh;
        }
        .photo {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            position: absolute;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px gray;
        }
        .envelope {
            width: 150px;
            height: 100px;
            background: url('envelope.png') no-repeat center center/cover;
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .message-box {
            display: none;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px gray;
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 500px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="photo-container">
        <img src="photo1.jpg" class="photo" style="top: 10%; left: 10%;">
        <img src="photo2.jpg" class="photo" style="top: 50%; left: 30%;">
        <img src="photo3.jpg" class="photo" style="top: 30%; left: 70%;">
        <img src="photo4.jpg" class="photo" style="top: 60%; left: 50%;">
    </div>
    <div class="envelope" onclick="showMessage()"></div>
    <div id="message" class="message-box">
        <p>"Dekh tune gift lene se toh mana kr diya but since mai ek acha dost hu, itna toh mai kr hi skta hu.</p>
        <p><strong>HAPPY BIRTHDAY Viiiiiiii 💗</strong></p>
        <p>Peechle 2 saalon mein koi humesha mere saath khada raha hai har time mein toh voh tu hi hai.<br>
        Apne voh 3 AM wale calls mere liye sbse badhe therapy rahe hai.<br>
        Mai kisi se itna open up nhi ho paya hu jitna tere sath hota hu, that makes you a very special friend.<br>
        And chahe apan kitna bhi jhagadte ho, maine kbhi tere baare mein galat nahi socha hai aur na hi kbhi sochunga.</p>
        <p>I know ki maine tujhe boht pareshan aur dukhi kiya hai recent times mein, So uske liye I AM AGAIN VERY VERY SORRY.<br>
        And meri ek hi wish rahegi humesha ki jab tk apni ye friendship hai tb tk tu humesha mere side khade rahe.</p>
        <p>( Dekh likhne ko toh boht kuch likhna hai but ye website bnane mein boht mehnat lagi hai isliye idhr k liye itna hi )</p>
    </div>
    
    <script>
        function showMessage() {
            document.getElementById('message').style.display = 'block';
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
